<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<RecordType xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <!--
        THIS NOTE LIVES IN A COMMENT, NOT IN <description>, AND IT MUST STAY THAT WAY.
        RecordType.Description is capped at 255 characters. The full rationale below is
        operationally important, so it was moved here rather than trimmed; a comment is
        repo-only and is never sent to the Metadata API. Do not paste this back into
        <description>. NOTE ALSO: the comment must sit INSIDE the root element - a comment
        placed ABOVE <RecordType> breaks `sf` deploy at source conversion with a misleading
        "unable to find matching parent xml file" error.

        THE BROKER-LISTED DISPOSITION PATH.
        Disposition Readiness, BOV Outreach, Active Listing, Call for Offers, LOI, PSA,
        Closing, Completed.

        THIS IS THE DEFAULT TYPE. DispositionService.findOrCreate stamps it EXPLICITLY when
        the Sell Meter creates a disposition (design Q1 answer (a)), rather than leaving
        RecordTypeId null and inheriting the running user's PROFILE default - profiles are
        .forceignore'd, so that default is org state this repo cannot see, set or verify.
        An off-market deal is switched by changing the record type early, while the record
        is still at Disposition Readiness.

        Disposition_Stage__c is restricted here to the EIGHT on-market stages. NDA and
        Disposition Offer are off-market stage values ONLY and are deliberately excluded -
        the source document narrates a buyer NDA and an offer inside the on-market path too,
        but as RECORDS surfaced during other stages, not as stages. Do not "helpfully" add
        them here.

        Sell_Decision_Trigger__c is enumerated in full because a record type file must list
        EVERY picklist on the object or values are silently dropped from that type.
        Disposition__c has exactly two picklists today.

        No <businessProcess> - that element is for Opportunity, Case, Lead and Solution only.
    -->
    <fullName>On_Market</fullName>
    <active>true</active>
    <description>The broker-listed disposition path: Readiness, BOV Outreach, Active Listing, Call for Offers, LOI, PSA, Closing, Completed. The default type, stamped by DispositionService.findOrCreate. See the XML comment in this file for full rationale.</description>
    <label>On Market</label>
    <picklistValues>
        <picklist>Disposition_Stage__c</picklist>
        <values>
            <fullName>Disposition Readiness</fullName>
            <default>true</default>
        </values>
        <values>
            <fullName>BOV Outreach</fullName>
            <default>false</default>
        </values>
        <values>
            <fullName>Active Listing</fullName>
            <default>false</default>
        </values>
        <values>
            <fullName>Call for Offers</fullName>
            <default>false</default>
        </values>
        <values>
            <fullName>LOI</fullName>
            <default>false</default>
        </values>
        <values>
            <fullName>PSA</fullName>
            <default>false</default>
        </values>
        <values>
            <fullName>Closing</fullName>
            <default>false</default>
        </values>
        <values>
            <fullName>Completed</fullName>
            <default>false</default>
        </values>
    </picklistValues>
    <picklistValues>
        <picklist>Sell_Decision_Trigger__c</picklist>
        <values>
            <fullName>Sell Meter Green</fullName>
            <default>true</default>
        </values>
        <values>
            <fullName>Principal Decision</fullName>
            <default>false</default>
        </values>
        <values>
            <fullName>Fund Maturity</fullName>
            <default>false</default>
        </values>
        <values>
            <fullName>Market Opportunity</fullName>
            <default>false</default>
        </values>
    </picklistValues>
</RecordType>
